  m_Name: unit_830628
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Grieving Dryad Alraune
  unitId: 830628
  unitNumber: 8460
  description: "Born of the enchanted energies within the Vale, Alraune was originally
    an earth spirit who nurtured the land and its inhabitants. Her motherly and placid
    nature was familiar to all in her section of the Vale; deer rested by her feet
    and birds chirped their songs atop her shoulders.When the Voidborn attacked,
    Alraune rose in defense of her home, heaving immense roots from the earth that
    tore through the ranks of the invaders. As her \"\"children\"\" fell one after
    another in the onslaught, Alraune was overcome with sorrow and rage, and sought
    blood for blood. The Voidborn's corrupted essence soaked the earth and seeped
    into her roots, sapping away at her life force, until Alraune was drained of
    all her strength. It was then that a chilling presence materialized before her
    blurring vision.The Voidbringer, Ensa-Taya, was intrigued by this unexpected
    resistance. Seeing in Alraune a reflection of Zeruiah's obstinance, Ensa-Taya
    bent the weakened spirit to her dark will\u2014an insult to the Vale, whose guardian
    dared resist her. Steeped in mental fog and Voidborn poison, Alraune came to
    see the alien creatures as the \"\"children\"\" she once cared for, unknowing
    of the tragic misidentification. For her beloved brood, she would do anything
    to ensure their safety\u2014even as her forests burned to ash with the hellish
    light of stolen Faefire."
  summonDesc: Oh, child... 'Tis passing strange that I was called to you in such
    a manner...<br>Who are you?
  fusionDesc: My children...I was powerless to save you before. This burning within
    my veins...it hurts.
  evoDesc: Do not worry, little one.<br>I am willing to endure many things for your
    sake.
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
